WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.590
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.410
I knew you were a fake!

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:21.910
A monster!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.290
You'll have to disappear here.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.740
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.230
Help, Go Go Man!

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:15.610
You're finished!

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.530
Go Go Man!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.960
Stop!

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:23.080
Evil Creature Bucketgon!
Don't touch my friend!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.990
Who goes there?!

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.910
I'm the defender of justice,

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:29.870
Go Go Man!

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:33.210
A hero protects his friends!
Go, go, fight!

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:36.010
Go Go Man's strong! Go, go!

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:37.090
Go, go!

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.800
Go, go!!

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.680
Here goes! Go, go!

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:41.800
Go, go!

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.290
CHAPTER 44

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:52.350
MASQUERADE
NOPPERABO

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:57.860
<i>It's time for the upbeat
variety show, Hiking!</i>

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:02.990
Today's guests are from the idol unit
that's quietly growing in popularity,

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:05.970
the two members of Paradise!

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:08.680
Greetings. I'm Yu.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.770
Hey there! I'm Atsushi!

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:17.650
Together, we're Paradise!

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:25.020
Ah, Yu-kun,  you're
as eloquently prince-like as ever.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:26.560
Thank you very much.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.480
And Atsushi-kun is ever the playboy.

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:34.940
Wait, seriously?
I'm a pretty straight-laced guy.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.530
No way!

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.280
-You're kidding. That's not possible!
-Yay, yay, yay, yay!

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.880
-Tell the truth.
-Yay, yay, yay, yay!

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.120
Actually,

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.220
I'm a girl-loving maniac!

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.270
Let's go to commercial.

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.680
You girls are cute.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:02.530
Tell me your RAIN IDs.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.360
Really?

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:09.180
Atsushi, why don't you get their IDs, too?

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.540
Nah. That's okay.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.940
Five seconds to airing.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.920
4... 3... 2...

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.070
Now for a special guest!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:26.290
With his new movie in theaters,
it's the super hero, Go Go Man-san!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.580
Go! The defender of justice, Go Go Man!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:31.870
Seriously?!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.580
Go Go Man?! Oh wow! Why?

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.090
Go Go Man!

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:40.260
Nobody told me!
I can't believe I'd meet you here!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:44.840
U-Um... Atsushi-kun,
do you like Go Go Man?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.390
"Like" doesn't begin to describe it!

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:50.600
I've been a fan since kindergarten!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:55.480
<i>I'm always saving up my money
to buy Go Go Man figures!</i>

00:04:55.480 --> 00:05:01.150
<i>The last one cost a whopping 400,000 yen,
but that detail was worth it!</i>

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.410
<i>The paint job was especially great.</i>

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:08.820
<i>Th-This is an unexpected side
to the playboy Atsushi-kun.</i>

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.500
I just pretend to be a playboy!

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.430
I just do it because
they told me to and...

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.960
Lesson costs, PR costs, HR costs!

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:27.870
<i>"He's an </i>otaku<i>...</i>
<i>He was seriously freaky today. LOL"</i>

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.970
Just how much do you think
I've spent on you?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.970
You were finally earning it back,
and now this!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.020
I'm sorry.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:39.100
After all I've done for you!
Atsushi, you're scum!

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.610
That's right.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:45.450
Do you have any idea how important
this time is for Paradise?

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:46.740
I'm sorry.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:51.180
What?! Get on your hands and knees
if you want to apologize!

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.370
<i>What... am I doing?</i>

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:01.980
I'm a girl-loving maniac!

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.340
<i>Who... is that?</i>

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.280
<i>That thing isn't me.</i>

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:11.430
<i>Nobody sees the real me at all.</i>

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.450
<i>Who is everyone cheering for?</i>

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.310
<i>The real me?</i>

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.900
<i>Who is the real me?</i>

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.420
Hurry and bow!

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:27.780
Before Atsushi Kitajima,
you're a member of Paradise.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:31.700
Swear you'll give your life for
Paradise's popularity!

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.530
<i>Is this going to go on my whole life?</i>

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:39.020
<i>What about the real me?</i>

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.850
Are you listening?

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.610
I'm... very sorry.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.710
GO GO MANJIRO

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.810
<i>Howdy hey! Anything good happen today?</i>

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:03.150
<i>Good evening. Nothing really.</i>

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.360
<i>I've been a little down recently.</i>

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.860
<i>What's wrong? Did something happen?</i>

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:12.390
<i>I've just been feeling
less and less like myself.</i>

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:17.960
<i>What?! I get worried if you're not happy.</i>

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.390
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.350
<i>You know...</i>

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:25.590
<i>It's funny now that I think about it.</i>

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:26.940
<i>What is?</i>

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:35.470
<i>I only know you from online
and have never met you before,</i>

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:38.200
<i>but you're the closest person to me.</i>

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.500
<i>You're my best friend, too.</i>

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:56.970
<i>I want to meet you.</i>

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.580
Kitaro!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:03.540
What's wrong, Nopperabo?

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.590
I need your help, Kitaro!

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:08.710
In return, here, a soul tempura!

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.450
NOPPERABO

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.680
This'll go well with <i>sake</i>!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.260
Wait that's...

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.190
Th-This is...?!

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:31.360
Whoops. I forgot if anyone but me
eats that, their face comes off.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.280
M-My sweet mask...

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:37.870
Forget that. Why do you need
Kitaro's help, Nopperabo?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.870
Oh, right.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:43.580
I've been RAIN-ing with a human friend.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.630
He suddenly said he wants to meet me.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:53.260
But he's not a child,
so I don't know if he can even see me.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:58.510
Even if he can,
seeing this'll just shock him.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.940
Please, do something for me, Kitaro!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:04.270
Something?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:09.800
Um, excuse me.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.200
I'm Atsushi Kitajima.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.070
Are you Go Go Manjiro-san?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.280
Uh, yes.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:20.870
That's right. I'm, uh...

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.290
Uh, what was it?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.690
Well...

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.650
I'm Ge Ge Mantaro.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.000
That's the situation.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:35.760
I'm lost as to what to do.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:39.510
Do you like your current work,
Atsushi-san?

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:43.890
I thought if I joined
the entertainment industry

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:48.520
I could become a hero like Go Go Man.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:52.190
But, I got paired up with Yu.

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.590
Before I knew it, I was some
manufactured idol.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:10:00.160
Yu is much more star-like than me.
Plus he's handsome.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.370
Yu would be the prince,

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:07.020
and I'd be the playboy.
That's what the president said.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.920
Things got hard from there.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:14.670
Recently, I can't tell who's the real me.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:18.550
If it's that hard, why don't you quit?

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.970
You should live as you like.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.180
It's not that easy.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:26.930
But you're the first person
to say that to me.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:31.710
Actually, there was one more.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.760
Go, Ak-kun!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:42.200
I've forgotten his face and name,
but I loved playing with that kid.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:48.710
By the way, they've announced
they're making a new Go Go Man movie!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.410
Oh, really?

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.510
Aren't you glad?

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:55.690
Sure I'm glad.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:00.350
Thanks for today. I had fun.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.320
I did too.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.600
Thanks, Kitaro.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.770
Sure.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:09.560
Are you sure Ak-kun couldn't tell
you weren't me?

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.610
Probably.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.320
Really?

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:17.190
Nopperabo, why were you
in contact with Atsushi-san?

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:21.680
I used to play with Ak-kun a lot
when he was a kid.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:26.870
Children stand on the threshold
between human and <i>yokai</i>.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.620
He must have been able to
befriend a <i>yokai</i>.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:34.340
Of course, as an adult,
Atsushi-san's memories have changed.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.500
It seems he thinks
you were a human child.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.510
Hey, Ak-kun, let's play.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:45.310
Yeah. Ak-kun slowly
stopped believing in <i>yokai</i>.

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:48.240
And he stopped being able to see me.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.600
But I still wanted to be Ak-kun's friend.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.040
<i>"I'm bored."</i>

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:56.610
Then shouldn't you have gone after all?

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.500
<i>"Let's talk!"</i>

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:01.610
Atsushi-kun seemed troubled
and as if his heart has been weakened.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:05.930
He might be able to see you in his state.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:15.460
I'm Ge Ge Mantaro.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.630
Sure I'm glad.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:23.930
Are you sure you shouldn't have gone?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.720
Yeah. He probably couldn't see me anyway.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:32.480
I'm happy just being
Go Go Manjiro on RAIN.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.380
I knew you were a fake!

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:37.750
Atsushi-san.

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:40.780
Is that the real Manjiro-san?

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.590
Ak-kun, you can see me?!

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:45.360
A monster!

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:47.740
Wh-What are you?!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:50.080
Can't you tell? See? I'm...

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:54.250
You're my real RAIN companion?!
You were deceiving me!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.290
Were you going to eat me?!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.880
That's not...

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.980
Get away!

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.050
Nopperabo!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:04.970
Hey!

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:09.760
Manjiro-san... I trusted you!

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.520
Ak-kun...

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:17.650
NOPPERABO

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:22.150
BUG FRIEND

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.050
-<i>"No, no."</i>
-<i>"Oh, what should I do?"</i>

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.050
<i>"Look me in the eye and tell me."</i>

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:30.080
Atsushi, what's wrong?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.790
Yu, help me!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.660
A <i>yokai</i>! A <i>yokai</i> is trying to eat me!

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:37.670
What in the world?

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:39.730
Forget it. Just hop in.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.690
Right.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.760
A <i>yokai</i> is trying to eat you?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:50.830
Did getting scolded by the president
and me shake you up that much?

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:53.060
That's not it...

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.770
Forget it. Don't worry about that.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.900
I'll drive you home.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.040
Okay.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.820
Listen, Atsushi,

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:06.200
at this rate, Paradise is going to get
even more popular.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.580
I'm the prince and you're the playboy.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.660
They say the combination works.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:14.540
Are you listening, Atsushi?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.640
Yeah.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:17.600
I LOVE YU

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:17.600
Say, Yu...

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:23.170
I don't think I'm cut out
for the entertainment industry.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.670
Why all of a sudden?

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.260
I'm scared.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:31.830
The more I play a fake me,
the more I feel the real me disappearing.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:36.210
The real me? That's hilarious.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.750
What are you talking about?

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:40.560
Well...

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.190
I don't know.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:47.450
Atsushi, there is no "real me".

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:48.590
What?

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:53.200
I'll show you what
a "real me" really looks like.

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.040
Atsushi, listen.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:04.550
I need to become a popular idol
and be surrounded by tons of fans.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:10.570
If you say you're quitting Paradise,

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.740
you'll have to disappear here.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:20.650
"His partner mysteriously vanished.
A tragic idol left alone."

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:24.070
Human media loves that kind of
story, doesn't it?

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:28.690
And I'll get more food... I mean "fans".

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:30.320
What's going on?!

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.740
You've gotta take care of your fans.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:36.470
They're important food after all!

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.830
OSHIROI-BABAA

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:55.080
I'll eat them all.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.850
Including you.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:06.920
<i>"Help me!"</i>

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:14.820
<i>No! He was another </i>yokai<i> who deceived me!</i>

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:20.370
<i>"Help me!"</i>

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:21.810
Ak-kun!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:29.590
So, be eaten here,
or continue as an idol with me.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.510
Make your choice!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.160
Help me!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:41.680
That Atsushi human was pretty cruel.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:46.020
The moment he realized he was dealing
with a <i>yokai</i>, he does that.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.840
That's how it usually goes.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:56.890
Atsushi-san is...?!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:03.310
Oh well. There are plenty of other
potential idols who can take your place.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.500
Go Go Punch!

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:09.380
You! Why?!

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:13.180
Because...
Because you're my friend, Ak-kun!

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.680
But you deceived me...

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:19.680
Wait, the only person to call me Ak-kun...

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.570
Go, Ak-kun!

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:24.620
Nono-kun!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.780
Nono-kun...

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:32.820
That's what you called me, Ak-kun.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.990
Wait, could it be...?

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.550
You're... Nono-kun?

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:41.970
Because of my face,
human children wouldn't play with me.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:46.830
I hated having no face,
so I was always drawing fake faces.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:51.190
But it never worked out.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:56.380
Come on, let's play! Come on!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:59.370
I guess they're scared.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:01.620
I'm not scared.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.790
You're not scared of me?

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:09.190
I'm not scared.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.460
A hero never gets scared!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.720
That's better!

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:23.970
I'll be your friend!

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:27.810
You were my friend...

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:30.900
and the greatest hero of all.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.800
Nono-kun!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.150
Ak-kun!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.770
The lesson you taught me then,

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:45.390
is the lesson I'll teach you now.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:48.830
You don't have to
pretend to be someone else.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:54.090
People can only live
as who they really are!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:57.610
You got in my way. How dare you!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.320
Ak-kun, hurry and run!

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.970
You won't escape!

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:04.990
Ak-kun, run!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.540
I'm...

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.670
I'm...

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:17.280
I'm the defender of justice,

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:19.240
Go Go Man!

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:27.040
I won't abandon my friend!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:35.070
I'm a weakling who only does as he's told.
I can't speak for myself.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.570
I'm not a hero at all.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.120
But I'll never abandon my friend!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:44.530
That's the real me.
That's Atsushi Kitajima!

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:47.870
You fool! You can both die!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.980
Poison Powder!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.030
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.510
Who dares?!

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.490
Kitaro!

00:20:02.820 --> 00:20:05.510
Oshiroi-Babaa, try fighting me!

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:07.140
Hair Needles!

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.370
Powder Hat!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.090
Finger Guns!

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:27.040
Are you okay?

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.410
Yeah, barely.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.500
Me too.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:33.290
Thanks. Thanks, Nono-kun!

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:35.420
I've wanted to say this forever.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.320
Thanks, Ak-kun!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:44.470
Today's guest suddenly switched agencies.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:48.510
With a graceful switch
from playboy to hero freak,

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:52.600
it's the increasingly popular
Atsushi Kitajima-kun!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:56.570
I'm the gloomy hero freak,

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:59.840
Atsushi Kitajima!

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:08.720
NONO-KUN

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.720
<i>Ak-kun, you can do it!!!</i>

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.580
Kitaro, won't you use a smartphone?

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.770
I don't need one.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:17.050
I thought as much.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:19.920
Do you know what this is?
It's an analog version of RAIN...

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.130
Oh! An exchange diary!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.390
Hi.

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:24.890
Are your wounds better?

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:25.890
Yeah.

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:31.580
You know, RAIN's good, but I was wanting
to do an exchange diary with Ak-kun.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.940
Did you get that for me, Catchick-san?

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:39.420
Nice, Catchick. How considerate.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:41.990
R-Right!

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:46.030
Of course I bought this for you two!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:50.370
Thanks!
I'll try it with Ak-kun right away!

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:53.270
Thanks a lot! Bye!

